1
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,790
Peringkat delapan puluh—

2
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:09,208
Chen Dayou, dari Qingzhou!

3
00:00:09,291 --> 00:00:10,780
Mulai dari yang terakhir

4
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:11,543
dibaca ke atas?

5
00:00:12,232 --> 00:00:12,932
Delapan puluh nama,

6
00:00:13,798 --> 00:00:15,454
sabar saja.

7
00:00:15,686 --> 00:00:16,345
Wah,

8
00:00:16,698 --> 00:00:19,600
Sarjana Xu juga datang lihat pengumuman?

9
00:00:21,736 --> 00:00:23,251
Kalau dia lulus,

10
00:00:23,691 --> 00:00:25,502
aku jalan mundur!

11
00:00:25,573 --> 00:00:25,835
Tuan Zhou,

12
00:00:27,044 --> 00:00:28,066
ikat tali sepatu dulu.

13
00:00:28,122 --> 00:00:28,886
Janji, ya,

14
00:00:29,177 --> 00:00:30,877
jalan mundur satu jalan penuh.

15
00:00:30,943 --> 00:00:32,480
Semua sudah dengar.

16
00:00:39,138 --> 00:00:40,176
Yang dicoret…

17
00:00:41,731 --> 00:00:42,948
Penguji Feng!

18
00:00:43,781 --> 00:00:46,123
P-penguji dicoret satu,

19
00:00:47,198 --> 00:00:49,190
apa artinya.

20
00:00:50,741 --> 00:00:51,513
Pengujinya dicoret,

21
00:00:51,584 --> 00:00:52,123
lalu daftarnya?

22
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,182
Peringkat sepuluh—

23
00:00:54,244 --> 00:00:57,759
Lin Shi'an, dari kota!

24
00:00:57,844 --> 00:00:58,817
Peringkat tiga—

25
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:02,779
Li Shouzheng, dari Qingzhou!

26
00:01:04,429 --> 00:01:05,374
Peringkat dua—

27
00:01:05,807 --> 00:01:07,845
Zhao Wenyuan, dari kota!

28
00:01:09,171 --> 00:01:11,582
Ha ha ha!

29
00:01:12,382 --> 00:01:14,237
Tiga besar pun tak ada dia!

30
00:01:15,068 --> 00:01:15,999
Cepat baca…

31
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:19,518
Kamu tidak tegang?

32
00:01:19,690 --> 00:01:20,118
Tegang.

33
00:01:20,324 --> 00:01:22,415
Telapak tanganku basah keringat.

34
00:01:23,246 --> 00:01:24,559
Juara pertama—

35
00:01:24,833 --> 00:01:26,942
Liuxi, Kabupaten Qingshui,

36
00:01:27,963 --> 00:01:29,755
Xu Yan!

37
00:01:29,829 --> 00:01:30,328
…Aku?

38
00:01:33,029 --> 00:01:33,576
Lulus!

39
00:01:33,907 --> 00:01:34,808
Juara pertama!

40
00:01:35,155 --> 00:01:36,530
Sudah kuduga.

41
00:01:37,030 --> 00:01:38,269
Misi ujian provinsi selesai.

42
00:01:39,549 --> 00:01:42,598
Hadiah: cetak huruf lepas.

43
00:01:42,687 --> 00:01:44,019
Huruf lepas…

44
00:01:44,132 --> 00:01:45,723
harus cari tukang ukir.

45
00:01:47,354 --> 00:01:48,039
Permisi…

46
00:01:48,263 --> 00:01:49,694
Permisi…

47
00:01:50,011 --> 00:01:50,626
Baru setengah,

48
00:01:51,216 --> 00:01:51,643
semangat, Tuan Zhou!

49
00:01:52,899 --> 00:01:53,792
Aku…

50
00:01:53,854 --> 00:01:55,794
Iya, aku jalan!

51
00:01:56,621 --> 00:01:57,568
Satu jalan,

52
00:01:57,718 --> 00:01:59,360
kurang selangkah pun tak boleh.

53
00:02:01,753 --> 00:02:02,260
Semua,

54
00:02:02,312 --> 00:02:03,083
mari bergembira bersama!

55
00:02:03,476 --> 00:02:04,208
Xu Yan!

56
00:02:04,637 --> 00:02:05,363
Sini!

57
00:02:07,682 --> 00:02:08,906
Ada apa?

58
00:02:09,059 --> 00:02:10,009
Malam ini,

59
00:02:10,569 --> 00:02:11,390
ada yang ingin kukatakan.
